Subject: [PATCH 41/57] route: a FakeIP address without a record goes by the
 sniffed domain

A connection to a FakeIP address whose record is gone is routed by the domain sniffed from it, with
a warning that says why.

Made of these commits of the earlier series (branch archive/r25-1.14-commits):
  83a43ee6c route: a FakeIP address without a record goes by the sniffed domain
  ec342a632 route: log a connection without a fakeip record as a warning that says why

